{"seq":2,"slug":"code-ownership-boundaries","title":"代码所有权与边界：CODEOWNERS 与模块边界约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/scaling/code-ownership-boundaries","wordCount":810,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"代码所有权与边界-codeowners-与模块边界约束\">代码所有权与边界：CODEOWNERS 与模块边界约束</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CODEOWNERS</td>\n<td>GitHub/GitLab 的特殊文件，定义文件/目录的审查责任人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模块边界约束</td>\n<td>通过 lint 规则在编译时强制包之间的依赖方向，防止边界侵蚀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tag</td>\n<td>Nx 中为项目标记的分类标签，是模块边界约束的基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>scope</td>\n<td>标记代码归属领域的 tag（如 <code>scope:auth</code>、<code>scope:payment</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>type</td>\n<td>标记代码类型的 tag（如 <code>type:feature</code>、<code>type:util</code>、<code>type:ui</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边界侵蚀</td>\n<td>随时间推移，原本清晰的模块边界被绕过或忽视，导致耦合失控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"codeowners-文件配置\">CODEOWNERS 文件配置</h2><p>CODEOWNERS 是 GitHub 和 GitLab 的内置代码所有权机制，当 PR 触及相关文件时，系统自动 request review 指定的团队或人员。</p>\n<h3 id=\"文件位置\">文件位置</h3><p>CODEOWNERS 文件可以放在以下三个位置之一（优先级从低到高）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\".github/CODEOWNERS      # GitHub 推荐位置&#10;docs/CODEOWNERS&#10;CODEOWNERS              # 根目录\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.github/CODEOWNERS      # GitHub 推荐位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>docs/CODEOWNERS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CODEOWNERS              # 根目录</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"基础语法\">基础语法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 全局默认负责人（无其他匹配时生效）&#10;* @myorg/platform-team&#10;&#10;# 特定目录（递归匹配）&#10;apps/web/ @myorg/web-team&#10;apps/mobile/ @myorg/mobile-team&#10;&#10;# 特定包（精确匹配目录）&#10;packages/ui/ @myorg/design-system-team @zhang-san&#10;&#10;# 特定文件类型&#10;*.sql @myorg/dba-team&#10;*.tf @myorg/infra-team&#10;&#10;# 重要配置文件&#10;package.json @myorg/platform-team&#10;pnpm-workspace.yaml @myorg/platform-team&#10;turbo.json @myorg/platform-team&#10;nx.json @myorg/platform-team\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 全局默认负责人（无其他匹配时生效）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>* @myorg/platform-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 特定目录（递归匹配）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>apps/web/ @myorg/web-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>apps/mobile/ @myorg/mobile-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 特定包（精确匹配目录）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>packages/ui/ @myorg/design-system-team @zhang-san</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 特定文件类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*.sql @myorg/dba-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*.tf @myorg/infra-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 重要配置文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package.json @myorg/platform-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pnpm-workspace.yaml @myorg/platform-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>turbo.json @myorg/platform-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>nx.json @myorg/platform-team</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"monorepo-中的-codeowners-最佳实践\">Monorepo 中的 CODEOWNERS 最佳实践</h3><p><strong>按功能域分组</strong>，而非按技术层次：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 认证功能域&#10;packages/auth-core/ @myorg/auth-team&#10;packages/auth-ui/ @myorg/auth-team&#10;apps/auth-service/ @myorg/auth-team&#10;&#10;# 支付功能域&#10;packages/payment/ @myorg/payment-team&#10;packages/checkout-ui/ @myorg/payment-team&#10;&#10;# 共享平台&#10;packages/utils/ @myorg/platform-team&#10;packages/ui/ @myorg/design-system-team&#10;tooling/ @myorg/platform-team\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 认证功能域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>packages/auth-core/ @myorg/auth-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>packages/auth-ui/ @myorg/auth-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>apps/auth-service/ @myorg/auth-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 支付功能域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>packages/payment/ @myorg/payment-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>packages/checkout-ui/ @myorg/payment-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 共享平台</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>packages/utils/ @myorg/platform-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>packages/ui/ @myorg/design-system-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tooling/ @myorg/platform-team</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>设置 Required Reviewers</strong>：在 GitHub Branch Protection 中配置&quot;Require review from code owners&quot;，强制被影响到的 CODEOWNERS 必须 approve 才能合并。</p>\n<h3 id=\"codeowners-的局限性\">CODEOWNERS 的局限性</h3><p>CODEOWNERS 只在 PR 层面强制审查，无法阻止<strong>代码写入时就违反边界</strong>（在 PR 被创建之前）。更主动的边界约束需要 lint 规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模块边界约束-nx-enforce-module-boundaries\">模块边界约束（@nx/enforce-module-boundaries）</h2><p><code>@nx/enforce-module-boundaries</code> 是 Nx 提供的 ESLint 规则，在代码编写时就强制包之间的依赖方向，将边界侵蚀消灭在萌芽状态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"tag-体系设计\">Tag 体系设计</h3><p>Tag 是模块边界约束的基础。常用的 tag 维度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"scope:    代码归属的业务域（scope:auth, scope:payment, scope:shared）&#10;type:     代码的技术类型（type:app, type:feature, type:ui, type:util, type:config）&#10;domain:   跨越 scope 的大领域分组（domain:frontend, domain:backend）&#10;layer:    架构分层（layer:0, layer:1, layer:2, layer:3）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>scope:    代码归属的业务域（scope:auth, scope:payment, scope:shared）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type:     代码的技术类型（type:app, type:feature, type:ui, type:util, type:config）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>domain:   跨越 scope 的大领域分组（domain:frontend, domain:backend）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layer:    架构分层（layer:0, layer:1, layer:2, layer:3）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 <code>project.json</code> 中为每个包打标签：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/auth-ui&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tags&quot;: [&quot;scope:auth&quot;, &quot;type:ui&quot;, &quot;domain:frontend&quot;, &quot;layer:3&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/auth-ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scope:auth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type:ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"domain:frontend\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"layer:3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/utils&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tags&quot;: [&quot;scope:shared&quot;, &quot;type:util&quot;, &quot;domain:both&quot;, &quot;layer:1&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scope:shared\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type:util\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"domain:both\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"layer:1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/payment&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tags&quot;: [&quot;scope:payment&quot;, &quot;type:feature&quot;, &quot;domain:backend&quot;, &quot;layer:2&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/payment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scope:payment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type:feature\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"domain:backend\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"layer:2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"eslint-规则配置\">ESLint 规则配置</h3><p>在根 <code>eslint.config.js</code> 中配置约束：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { FlatCompat } from &#39;@eslint/eslintrc&#39;;&#10;import nxEslintPlugin from &#39;@nx/eslint-plugin&#39;;&#10;&#10;const compat = new FlatCompat();&#10;&#10;export default [&#10;  ...compat.extends(&#39;plugin:@nx/typescript&#39;),&#10;  {&#10;    plugins: { &#39;@nx&#39;: nxEslintPlugin },&#10;    rules: {&#10;      &#39;@nx/enforce-module-boundaries&#39;: [&#10;        &#39;error&#39;,&#10;        {&#10;          enforceBuildableLibDependency: true,&#10;          allow: [],&#10;          depConstraints: [&#10;            // type:app 只能依赖 feature、ui、util、config&#10;            {&#10;              sourceTag: &#39;type:app&#39;,&#10;              onlyDependOnLibsWithTags: [&#39;type:feature&#39;, &#39;type:ui&#39;, &#39;type:util&#39;, &#39;type:config&#39;],&#10;            },&#10;            // type:feature 只能依赖 ui、util、config（不能依赖 feature）&#10;            {&#10;              sourceTag: &#39;type:feature&#39;,&#10;              onlyDependOnLibsWithTags: [&#39;type:ui&#39;, &#39;type:util&#39;, &#39;type:config&#39;],&#10;            },&#10;            // type:ui 只能依赖 util、config&#10;            {&#10;              sourceTag: &#39;type:ui&#39;,&#10;              onlyDependOnLibsWithTags: [&#39;type:util&#39;, &#39;type:config&#39;],&#10;            },&#10;            // scope:auth 不能依赖 scope:payment（业务域隔离）&#10;            {&#10;              sourceTag: &#39;scope:auth&#39;,&#10;              notDependOnLibsWithTags: [&#39;scope:payment&#39;],&#10;            },&#10;            // scope:payment 不能依赖 scope:auth&#10;            {&#10;              sourceTag: &#39;scope:payment&#39;,&#10;              notDependOnLibsWithTags: [&#39;scope:auth&#39;],&#10;            },&#10;          ],&#10;        },&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { FlatCompat } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@eslint/eslintrc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nxEslintPlugin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@nx/eslint-plugin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> compat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FlatCompat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">compat.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">extends</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'plugin:@nx/typescript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    plugins: { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@nx'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: nxEslintPlugin },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rules: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '@nx/enforce-module-boundaries'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          enforceBuildableLibDependency: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          allow: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          depConstraints: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // type:app 只能依赖 feature、ui、util、config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              sourceTag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type:app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              onlyDependOnLibsWithTags: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type:feature'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type:ui'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type:util'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type:config'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // type:feature 只能依赖 ui、util、config（不能依赖 feature）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              sourceTag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type:feature'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              onlyDependOnLibsWithTags: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type:ui'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type:util'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type:config'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // type:ui 只能依赖 util、config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              sourceTag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type:ui'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              onlyDependOnLibsWithTags: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type:util'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type:config'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // scope:auth 不能依赖 scope:payment（业务域隔离）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              sourceTag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'scope:auth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              notDependOnLibsWithTags: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'scope:payment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // scope:payment 不能依赖 scope:auth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              sourceTag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'scope:payment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              notDependOnLibsWithTags: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'scope:auth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"边界约束违规示例\">边界约束违规示例</h3><p>当 <code>packages/ui/src/button.tsx</code> 中尝试引入 <code>@myorg/payment</code>（<code>type:feature</code>）时，ESLint 会立即报错：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"ESLint: A project tagged with &quot;type:ui&quot; can only depend on libs tagged with &quot;type:util&quot;, &quot;type:config&quot;.&#10;(@nx/enforce-module-boundaries)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>ESLint: A project tagged with \"type:ui\" can only depend on libs tagged with \"type:util\", \"type:config\".</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(@nx/enforce-module-boundaries)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个错误在开发时就出现（而非 PR 时），大幅降低边界侵蚀的修复成本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;type:app\\napps/web&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;type:feature\\npackages/checkout&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;type:ui\\npackages/ui&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;type:util\\npackages/utils&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;type:config\\ntooling/tsconfig&quot;]&#10;&#10;    X[&quot;scope:auth\\npackages/auth&quot;] -. X 禁止 .-&gt; Y[&quot;scope:payment\\npackages/payment&quot;]&#10;    Y -. X 禁止 .-&gt; X\">graph TD\n    A[\"type:app\\napps/web\"] --&gt; B[\"type:feature\\npackages/checkout\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"type:ui\\npackages/ui\"]\n    B --&gt; C\n    B --&gt; D[\"type:util\\npackages/utils\"]\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[\"type:config\\ntooling/tsconfig\"]\n\n    X[\"scope:auth\\npackages/auth\"] -. X 禁止 .-&gt; Y[\"scope:payment\\npackages/payment\"]\n    Y -. X 禁止 .-&gt; X</pre><h2 id=\"不使用-nx-的边界约束方案\">不使用 Nx 的边界约束方案</h2><p>对于未使用 Nx 的项目，也有替代方案实现模块边界约束。</p>\n<h3 id=\"eslint-plugin-import-配置\">eslint-plugin-import 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// eslint.config.js&#10;import importPlugin from &#39;eslint-plugin-import&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default [&#10;  {&#10;    plugins: { import: importPlugin },&#10;    rules: {&#10;      // 禁止跨业务域的引用（需要自定义模式）&#10;      &#39;import/no-restricted-paths&#39;: [&#10;        &#39;error&#39;,&#10;        {&#10;          zones: [&#10;            {&#10;              target: &#39;./packages/auth&#39;,&#10;              from: &#39;./packages/payment&#39;,&#10;              message: &#39;auth 包不能依赖 payment 包&#39;,&#10;            },&#10;            {&#10;              target: &#39;./packages/payment&#39;,&#10;              from: &#39;./packages/auth&#39;,&#10;              message: &#39;payment 包不能依赖 auth 包&#39;,&#10;            },&#10;          ],&#10;        },&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// eslint.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> importPlugin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'eslint-plugin-import'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    plugins: { import: importPlugin },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rules: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 禁止跨业务域的引用（需要自定义模式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'import/no-restricted-paths'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          zones: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              target: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./packages/auth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              from: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./packages/payment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'auth 包不能依赖 payment 包'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              target: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./packages/payment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              from: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./packages/auth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'payment 包不能依赖 auth 包'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"治理成熟度模型\">治理成熟度模型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L0：无治理</td>\n<td>无任何边界约束，依赖全靠自觉</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L1：CODEOWNERS</td>\n<td>PR 审查阶段才发现边界违规</td>\n<td>CODEOWNERS + Branch Protection</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2：静态分析</td>\n<td>编写时发现边界违规（非 Nx 项目）</td>\n<td>eslint-plugin-import</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3：语义化约束</td>\n<td>基于业务域 tag 的细粒度约束（Nx 项目）</td>\n<td>@nx/enforce-module-boundaries</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4：运行时监控</td>\n<td>生产环境检测实际依赖路径</td>\n<td>依赖分析 + 告警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>代码所有权与边界是大型 Monorepo 长期可维护性的关键保障：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CODEOWNERS 是基础</strong>：PR 审查门控，确保每次变更都有相关人员参与</li>\n<li><strong>模块边界约束是主动防线</strong>：在代码编写时就发现违规，而非依赖人工审查</li>\n<li><strong>Tag 体系设计应按业务域而非技术层次</strong>：<code>scope:auth</code> 比 <code>layer:service</code> 更能反映真实边界</li>\n<li><strong>从 L1 开始，逐步升级</strong>：先配置 CODEOWNERS，再引入 lint 规则，避免一步到位带来的阻力</li>\n<li><strong><code>@nx/enforce-module-boundaries</code> 是 Nx 的杀手功能</strong>：在大型团队中，这一个规则的价值超过其他所有 Nx 功能</li>\n<li><strong>定期审查 Tag 配置</strong>：业务发展会带来边界变化，Tag 和约束规则需要随之更新</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章节相关文档：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"ci-optimization-monorepo\">CI 优化策略</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"migration-strategies\">迁移策略</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代码所有权与边界：CODEOWNERS 与模块边界约束","id":"代码所有权与边界-codeowners-与模块边界约束"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CODEOWNERS 文件配置","id":"codeowners-文件配置"},{"level":3,"text":"文件位置","id":"文件位置"},{"level":3,"text":"基础语法","id":"基础语法"},{"level":3,"text":"Monorepo 中的 CODEOWNERS 最佳实践","id":"monorepo-中的-codeowners-最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"CODEOWNERS 的局限性","id":"codeowners-的局限性"},{"level":2,"text":"模块边界约束（@nx/enforce-module-boundaries）","id":"模块边界约束-nx-enforce-module-boundaries"},{"level":3,"text":"Tag 体系设计","id":"tag-体系设计"},{"level":3,"text":"ESLint 规则配置","id":"eslint-规则配置"},{"level":3,"text":"边界约束违规示例","id":"边界约束违规示例"},{"level":2,"text":"不使用 Nx 的边界约束方案","id":"不使用-nx-的边界约束方案"},{"level":3,"text":"eslint-plugin-import 配置","id":"eslint-plugin-import-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"治理成熟度模型","id":"治理成熟度模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CI 优化策略：分片、并行与增量构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/scaling/ci-optimization-monorepo"},"next":{"title":"迁移策略：Polyrepo 到 Monorepo 的完整方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/scaling/migration-strategies"}}